{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陝西咸陽湖在大雨過後，出現「半濁半清」奇觀。湖中間由綠地分隔，從空中俯瞰，就如天然的「鴛鴦鍋」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SX.LAKE.MTV.0805-0814_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026SeaXQdbW811786670663.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SX.LAKE.MTV.0805-0814_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SX.LAKE.MTV.0805-0814_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026dZoIV12x5a1786670732.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SX.LAKE.MTV.0805-0814_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T02:00:05.464872+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":48,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}